<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px7" title="In 5.3 Ablation Studies ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ VAUQ: Vision-Aware Uncertainty Quantification for LVLM Self-Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">How does the proportion of the masked image patches <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math> affect performance?</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px8" title="In 5.3 Ablation Studies ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ VAUQ: Vision-Aware Uncertainty Quantification for LVLM Self-Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Parameter generalization across data distributions.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
